<title>AUSTRALIA: SOCCER-SOLOMON ISLANDS AND TAHITI DRAW 1-1.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-SOLOMON ISLANDS AND TAHITI DRAW 1-1.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-06-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Solomon Islands and Tahiti drew</p>
<p>1-1 (halftime 1-1) in an Oceania group World Cup qualifying</p>
<p>match on Saturday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Solomon Islands - Jeffrey Kwaomae (42)</p>
<p>Tahiti - Jean Loup Rousseau (44)</p>
<p>Final standings:</p>
<p> Australia			    4    4  0   0  26   2   12</p>
<p> Solomon Islands		    4    1  1   2   7  21    4</p>
<p> Tahiti				 4    0  1   3   1  11    1</p>
<p>Australia now meet New Zealand in a playoff for the Oceania</p>
<p>title in June and July.</p>
</text>
